1
00:00:00,497 --> 00:00:02,267
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

2
00:00:02,265 --> 00:00:04,235
(Sheldon:)What are you doing now?

3
00:00:04,234 --> 00:00:06,704
(Raj:)Still making sure
the telescope's camera

4
00:00:06,703 --> 00:00:09,743
(Raj:)is white-field balanced.
Oh, I see.

5
00:00:13,443 --> 00:00:15,413
(Sheldon:)How about now?

6
00:00:15,412 --> 00:00:18,082
(Raj:)Now I'm making sure
the telescope's camera

7
00:00:18,081 --> 00:00:21,151
(Raj:)is white-field balanced and
wishing you had a coloring book.

8
00:00:21,151 --> 00:00:23,581
(Sheldon:)Well, I can be helpful.

9
00:00:23,587 --> 00:00:25,057
(Sheldon:)Give me something to do.

10
00:00:25,055 --> 00:00:27,325
(Sheldon:)You know, my father
took me to work once,

11
00:00:27,324 --> 00:00:28,954
(Sheldon:)and in ten minutes
I figured out

12
00:00:28,959 --> 00:00:30,659
(Sheldon:)who'd been stealing
from the cash register.

13
00:00:30,660 --> 00:00:31,760
(Sheldon:)It was my father.

14
00:00:31,762 --> 00:00:34,262
(Sheldon:)Yeah, Dad lost his job,

15
00:00:34,264 --> 00:00:37,934
(Sheldon:)but Mr. Hinckley
gave me a Fudgsicle.

16
00:00:37,934 --> 00:00:40,264
(Raj:)Fine, you want
something to do?

17
00:00:40,270 --> 00:00:43,510
(Raj:)There's about six months
of data on this hard drive.

18
00:00:43,507 --> 00:00:45,577
(Raj:)Why don't you go through it
and see if you can spot

19
00:00:45,575 --> 00:00:46,605
(Raj:)any patterns or anomalies.

20
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:48,880
(Sheldon:)Yep, I'm on it.
Hey, look at that!

21
00:00:48,879 --> 00:00:53,079
(Sheldon:)An Indian guy outsourcing
a computer job to a white fella.

22
00:00:53,083 --> 00:00:55,583
(Raj:)Yeah, okay,
whatever it takes

23
00:00:55,585 --> 00:00:57,415
(Raj:)to keep you busy
for a few hours.

24
00:00:57,421 --> 00:01:00,251
(Sheldon:)Found one.

